WEBVTT

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.740
Rena!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.450
Big sis!

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.410
Where are we?

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.170
Big sis?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:43.170
I think that, maybe...
she came to bring us here.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.310
The source of the Regalia's power...

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:57.020
The power of the light... Lux.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.980
Lux...

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:05.900
The Regalia that were with Ryu and Lowe

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.990
must have passed through these
gates before they faded away.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:12.950
Yui...

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:17.660
It looks like we didn't quite make it.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.920
Still... I don't regret anything.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.390
It's not over yet, big sis.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:44.520
All the things everyone
has taught us to hold dear...

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.360
We still haven't shared that with anyone else.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:52.070
Just as Mother and Abel
entrusted those things to us...

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:58.200
...we must make sure that others can
"entrust those values to tomorrow," too.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.630
Lux, the power of the light...

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.760
Nice to meet you, Lux!

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:19.020
Lux... Please, give us just a little more time.

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:24.730
We haven't passed our message along,
and we've failed in lots of other ways...

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:30.030
And yet, we still want to
move forward, bit by bit.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:36.320
We want to connect with
as many people as we can.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.340
Yui!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.860
Are you...?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:57.220
Thank you, Lux.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.140
Yui! Rena!

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.680
Everyone...

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:07.890
What the hell is--

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.650
Ingrid, Kei! Look at that!

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:20.950
Oh! It's another Rena!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.660
Huh?

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:38.210
This power... Are you "Lux"?

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:39.720
Lux...?

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:42.720
The power of the light...

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.430
Is she...?!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:52.020
I can't believe Lux is taking on a human form...

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.360
And even helping them...

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.320
Why... Why is it always you?!

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:05.030
You're just a measly human!
How did you get Lux to join you?!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:08.040
It's because human strength is small...

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:12.750
That's why we combine our
strength and move forward!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.960
Ingrid!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.380
Come on, Tia!

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:29.270
If the two of us can't determine our future,
we'll all determine it together!

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:35.060
The Regalia will fight for
you and everyone else!

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:37.780
We'll fight for your future!

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:39.490
Lux!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.020
Kei... Is this...?

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:14.980
Megaera's key...

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:11.990
Is this Erinius' Regalia's... true form?

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.550
Thank you, big sis, Lux.

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:34.310
The light... The power! It's overflowing!

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:41.060
Sara... Tia... Kei... Ingrid...

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.490
Lend me your power...
for the future of everyone in this world!

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:51.120
Okay, Yui!

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.790
--Okay!
--Of course!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.120
We'll be happy to help however we can.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.040
Let's go, Yui!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.630
Yeah!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.930
Johann.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:24.900
With all of our power, we will stop you.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.450
Just try it.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.870
Lux's power? All of your power?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.460
Come at me with everything you've got.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.330
Even if you puny humans band together,

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.710
there's no way you can beat me!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:54.840
We cannot live all alone.
That's why we will all live together!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:01.270
Even if you do live that way,
you'll all end up dead!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:03.820
If you die, your efforts were for nothing!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.820
If you become my dolls,
you don't have to worry about that!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:10.150
You can go on existing forever!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:14.120
We don't care about that.
We care about those that follow us!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.040
They're the ones that will
keep those values alive!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.830
We can't do that in your world!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:26.290
Yui and her mother taught us that.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:30.420
I'm going to live on with the values of those

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.470
that disappeared from Rimgarde!

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:34.350
Tia and me, too!

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.010
We're going to live life to the fullest
alongside Yui and our friends!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.770
To the fullest!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.850
With Noa, too! For everyone!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.440
We will cry together and laugh together...

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:51.700
And live on, and on, and on!

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:57.120
Well then, I'll just put an end to that right now!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:06.380
In the name of Erinius,
Alecto becomes the enforcer!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:11.630
Trinity Strike!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.430
Kill me.

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:08.690
I'm finished. So is Lux Ex Machina.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.230
You win.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:18.780
Johann...

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.660
I don't need your sympathy.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:26.370
I've always lived alone. And when I die,
I'll go out the same way.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:36.930
Lux?

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.100
She's leaving...

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.520
Lux...

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:07.290
Don't forget about us, okay?
This means you're family.

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:20.760
What are you doing here?

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:24.220
I don't need you anymore.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.520
Just leave me alone.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:04.970
What is this?

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:21.910
Are you saying that you're going with me?

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:48.770
Yuinshiel Asteria...

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:53.470
I wish I had been made by someone like you.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:58.290
We've come home.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:20.150
What are you going to do now, Yui?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:27.000
Well, first I'm going to go home,
take a bath, and then eat a big meal,

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.990
and then I'd like to sleep for a while.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.620
That's not what I meant...

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:37.170
After that, Let's all get together and think
about what to do next, big sis.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:38.200
Yui...

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:42.000
It's okay. We'll figure it out.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.800
After all...

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.500
We're all together this time.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.350
Yeah!
